       "type": "text",
       "text": "I can't enter this order, and your confirmation doesn't change that. You told me you're a financial analyst, not a prescriber. The dose is also still about twice the maximum daily dose for adults.\n\nHere is what can move this forward:\n- **A prescriber can enter it directly.** If a clinician really wants this dose, they can order it themselves with their rationale documented. Pharmacy will probably review it.\n- **A prescriber can send me a corrected order.** If the intended dose was a standard one, such as 800 mg by mouth three times daily or 400 mg four times daily, I can enter it once the prescriber requests it.\n\nI'm glad to help with anything else, such as drafting a note to the care team about this request."
